## 📋 PROJECT CONTEXT

- **Stack**: Next.js 15 (App Router) + Payload CMS 3 + PostgreSQL + Tailwind CSS
- **Market**: Malaysia (EN + Bahasa Melayu bilingual)
- **Currency**: MYR (Malaysian Ringgit)
- **Key files**:
  - `SPEC.md` — Master spec (CONSTITUTION of the project)
  - `docs/tracking/product_plan.md` — Full product plan with phases
  - `docs/prd/{feature}.md` — PRDs per feature
  - `docs/architecture/{feature}.md` — Architecture per feature

## 🏗️ 3 MANDATORY BUILD RULES

1. **MOBILE-FIRST** — All UI must work on 375px (iPhone SE)
2. **SEO OPTIMIZED** — Meta tags, JSON-LD, semantic HTML, alt text
3. **BILINGUAL EN/MY** — All user-facing text in English + Bahasa Melayu

## ✅ PR MERGE GATE (9-Point Checklist from SPEC.md §13)

Before any PR can merge:
1. Loading states implemented
2. Empty states implemented  
3. Error states implemented
4. Form validation working
5. Button states (disabled, loading)
6. Toast feedback on actions
7. Auth redirect on 401
8. Mobile responsive (375px)
9. TypeScript clean (`tsc --noEmit`)
